<p>This is a continuation of the Orcadian Saga, and something I spent the last <em>two</em> full months working on. It started off as crystals made from Finnfolk sacrificing themselves, and evolved into clusters of corpses, where the original themes were unclear it evolved to focus on sacrifice, loss, and desperation. This is one step closer to my 001 proposal. Thanks for all the help.</p>
